{
  "Combat.Minotaur.Attack.Text": "You are struck a glancing blow by [themonster]! "
  "Combat.Minotaur.CameWorms": "[pg]The minotaur picks you up and forcibly tosses you from his cave, grunting in displeasure."
  "Combat.Minotaur.MinoPheromones.Text": " The animalistic scent of it seems to get inside you, the musky aroma burning a path of liquid heat to your groin."
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Face": "slapping into your face before you can react! You wipe the slick snot-like stuff out of your eyes and nose, "
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Lead": "The minotaur smiles at you and lifts his loincloth, flicking it at you. Thick ropes of pre-cum fly through the air, "
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Lick": "feeling your heart beat with desire as your tongue licks the residue from your lips."
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Miss": "right past your head."
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Scent": " The animalistic scent of it seems to get inside you, the musky aroma burning a path of liquid heat to your groin."
  "Combat.Minotaur.Pheromones.Swallow": "swallowing it into your mouth without thinking."
}
